        "filing_date": "2026-01-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also operate a 24/7 year-round customer support center and offer on-call Gulfstream aircraft technicians ready to deploy around the world for customer service requirements under our Field and Airborne Support Team (FAST) rapid-response unit.",
